<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 1.167 BLN NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 1.167 BLN NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid for 342 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills, against the central bank's 450 million zloty offer, and for 825 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills, against a 750 million offer, the bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
